# SHA-256 for every checkpoint distributed with 'The Entropy Bridge'.
#
# The checkpoints are ~2.4 GB and are distributed as a separate archive rather
# than in git (see the "Model checkpoints" section of ../README.md). This file
# IS in git, so an unpacked archive can be checked against the repository:
#
#     cd models && sha256sum -c CHECKSUMS.sha256
#
# Regenerate with:  train/checksum_models.sh
#
# A mismatch means the file is not the one the paper's numbers came from. Do not
# proceed with a reproduction run; re-download instead.
#
